# AlphaPlantImpute intermediates. These used to be written to the working
# directory, which is how they ended up here; they now go to the run's output
# directory, but ignore them so an older checkout cannot commit one.
current_GenoTable.genotypes
currentVCFIDTab.txt
lib.phase
imputed_out.*

# rTASSEL / BGLR run artefacts
rtassel_log.txt
rTASSEL_log
*.dat
*.out

# ME-GP benchmarks. Scripts AND their inputs live together under
# inst/benchmarks so the folder can be copied to MSI as one self-contained
# unit, which puts ~18 MB of genotype/phenotype/enviromics data in the tree
# (a 13 MB VCF among it). None of it belongs in the package or in git history,
# so the whole folder is ignored and reaches the cluster by rsync/scp:
#   rsync -av inst/benchmarks/ user@msi:/scratch.global/user/pyt25_bench/code/
# Note this ignores the SCRIPTS too, by request. If they should be versioned
# later, un-ignore them individually and keep only data/ ignored.
inst/benchmarks/
